WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.450
Open Monitor from the server desktop.

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:07.000
Review the resource overview and expand the window.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.450
Inspect network throughput and interface counters.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:15.050
Open Services and select nginx.service.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:18.440
Read the log entries for the selected service.
